# Problem Set 2 – Summary

## Part 1 – Helper Functions
* `is_word_guessed`: Checks if all letters of the secret word are in guessed letters.
* `get_guessed_word`: Shows the current state of the word (e.g., `_ p p _ e`).
* `get_available_letters`: Returns all letters the user hasn't guessed yet.

## Part 2 – Hangman Game Loop
* 6 guesses, 3 warnings.
* Deducts 2 guesses for incorrect vowels, 1 for consonants.
* Ends when the word is guessed or guesses reach 0.

## Part 3 – Hangman with Hints
* If user enters '*', the program shows all potential matches in the dictionary that fit the current revealed letters.
